  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "All primary keys use UUID type for better distribution and security",
    "Passwords are stored as hashed values, not plain text",
    "User roles are stored as varchar to allow flexibility (patient, doctor, administrator)",
    "Appointment slots are derived from doctor_availability table based on day_of_week and time ranges",
    "Appointment status includes: scheduled, confirmed, cancelled, completed, no_show",
    "Notification channels include: email (SendGrid), sms (Twilio), and push notifications",
    "Consultation fees are stored in cents to avoid floating point precision issues",
    "Doctor availability uses day_of_week (0-6) and time strings (HH:MM) for recurring weekly schedules",
    "Many-to-many relationship between doctors and specialties allows doctors to have multiple specialties",
    "Timestamps use timezone-aware timestamp type for accurate scheduling across time zones",
    "Soft delete pattern not implemented; is_active flags used where needed",
    "Appointment reminders are sent 24 hours before the scheduled time as per requirements",
    "Email confirmations are sent upon patient registration and appointment booking",
    "Doctor receives instant notifications for new bookings",
    "Cancellation tracking includes who cancelled, when, and why for audit purposes",
    "Index on appointment_date and start_time for efficient schedule queries",
    "Index on email for fast user lookup during authentication"
  ]
}